cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Taintline: Taint tracking for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Taintline labels every piece of an AI agent's context by where it came from,
  follows those labels into tool-call arguments, and blocks or escalates calls
  where untrusted data reaches a sensitive argument.
authors:
